 1 → so jet-ski must be in position 2.\n\nTherefore:\n- Position 2: Transport = jet-ski  \n→ Then Position 1: Transport = tram (only other option)\n\nNow, pets: ferret is in position 1 → so position 2 has lizard.\n\nLet’s summarize:\n\n**Position 1:**\n- Movie: crime  \n- Pet: ferret  \n- Transport: tram\n\n**Position 2:**\n- Movie: animation  \n- Pet: lizard  \n- Transport: jet-ski\n\nNow, answer the questions:\n\n1. **What is the movie genre of the person who has a ferret?**  \n   → Ferret is in position 1 → movie = crime  \n   → Answer: crime\n\n2. **What movie genre does the person in position 2 watch?**  \n   → Position 2: animation  \n   → Answer: animation\n\n3. **What transport does the person in position 2 use?**  \n   → Position 2: jet-ski  \n   → Answer: jet-ski\n\n4. **What transport does the person who has a ferret use?**  \n   → Ferret is in position 1 → transport = tram  \n   → Answer: tram\n\nFinal answers in order: crime, animation, jet-ski, tram\n\nFinal answer: <solution>crime, animation, jet-ski, tram</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.038041986525058746}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.07898911088705063}, {"token": " given", "logprob": -0.5759408473968506}, {"token": ":\n\n", "logprob": -0.6794371604919434}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -0.0008573431987315416}, {"token": " Two", "logprob": -0.1533564031124115}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -1.0847986231965479e-05}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.0054343827068805695}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.003217878518626094}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.16024836897850037}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.24713876843452454}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.04091133177280426}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.00023755589791107923}, {"token": "left", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -1.4066597032069694e-05}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.0015023384476080537}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.